WEBVTT

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:51.220
We can finally intervene.

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:55.220
<i>Kaiju </i>appearing in a world
weakens the barrier.

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:57.890
It's early for two at once.

00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:01.600
Go on, Knight! Do your best!

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:04.440
Of course. That's my duty.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.570
What the--?!

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:17.530
A giant?!

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:19.820
What's Our Reason for Coming Together?

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:19.820
Episode 7

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:33.420
Hey, hey, hey! What the hell?!

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.680
Get lost!

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:39.430
So fast!

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:41.600
What is that thing?

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:44.440
Is that a <i>kaiju</i>, too?

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:46.060
I can't control it.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.060
Dammit!

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:49.820
--Gridknight Storm!
--Stay still!

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.240
Onija, let me take over!

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.030
Chill! Just relax!

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.830
You guys, let's withdraw for now.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.460
We've got this!

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.840
We can beat Gauma this time!

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:12.050
But...

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:16.800
It would be a waste to lose this <i>kaiju</i>.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.850
Fine.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.110
That was close.

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:34.150
It saved us?

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.950
Thank god it's not an enemy.

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:40.490
I take it back!

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.700
You asked for it!

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:55.510
What?! Where'd it go?!
This ain't over yet!

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:05.560
Dammit! Now it's all beat up!

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:10.350
And to think they entrusted
Dynazenon to me!

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.360
Huh?

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:19.070
Hey, Koyomi! Where are you going?!

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:22.490
Eh? What's up with him?

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:25.990
Whatever. Let's look for the <i>kaiju</i>.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:26.750
Huh?

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:31.710
You guys search from above.
It couldn't have gotten far.

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:42.760
Shit. I've gotta fix it somehow.
We can't fight like this.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:48.980
I'm not seeing the <i>kaiju</i>.

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:59.860
Sorry. I wasn't watching my energy.

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.610
It's no big deal.

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:06.330
Let's just keep an eye on things.

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:15.380
What's with this purple guy?

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.460
IT'S TIME TO CHANGE CAPITALS IF TOKYO'S LIKE THIS.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:26.260
Shit. Was that giant a <i>kaiju</i>?

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.520
Not sure, but I couldn't control it.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:31.310
We made another enemy.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:35.360
It's natural to make enemies
when you change things.

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:41.030
Our <i>kaiju </i>was pretty strong.
If we play it right, we can win.

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:45.280
You're surprisingly pumped up.
Something happen?

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:46.120
No.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:50.040
Ah! You're pissed
'cuz that guy hugged you!

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:53.960
Hey, hey! Looks like Mujina's
got a cute side--

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:58.300
It's not like that.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:00.630
I messed things up.

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:04.640
I'm just taking responsibility for it.

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:13.980
I knew it.

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:17.060
This is Arata. Uh, my husband.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.530
She always talks about you, Yamamoto.

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:25.240
You've known her since middle school,
right? Was she always like this?

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.380
You work nearby?

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:40.590
Hmm? You could say that.
I... help people in need.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:42.590
That's amazing!

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:47.300
Are you okay, uh, Tachibana?!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.680
Hello?! Anyone there?!

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:57.520
Found you.

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:05.280
Gauma sure is late.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.660
Are you mad?

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.490
I'm not mad.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.120
Yeah, you are.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.130
He's back.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:24.670
I feel like shit right now.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.050
The <i>kaiju</i>?

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:28.550
No use. Couldn't find it.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:30.010
I see.

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:38.560
I'm starving. Let's grab something to eat.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:51.160
Sorry about earlier... For teasing you.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:56.000
But you being serious
for a change ain't half bad.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.710
Just so we're clear,

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:04.550
we don't fight to settle
personal grudges, you know?

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:08.220
The power of <i>kaiju</i>
isn't for killing people.

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:11.350
It's for killing humanity as a whole.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:18.140
I don't always get
the things you guys say,

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.730
but I'll go along with it this time.

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.530
Thanks for the meal!

00:08:27.530 --> 00:08:29.950
Man, I'm stuffed!

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:34.910
That's better! Now we're pumped
and ready to roll, right?

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:37.620
What? Sure.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.540
Thanks for the meal.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:49.050
Jeez, there you are! I finally found you!

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:50.510
Chise?

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:51.840
Why are you here?

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:56.270
What a mean thing to say
to a comrade in arms!

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:58.730
I know, but...

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:00.940
Hmm? Where's Senpai?

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:04.480
Who the hell knows? He ran off.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.940
Huh? On his own?

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:13.280
Yeah, and hope he comes back quick.
We'll be up all night.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.280
Huh? All night?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:19.830
Waiting for the <i>kaiju</i>.
What about you guys?

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.040
I'll stay, too.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.040
Huh?

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:29.510
I'll tell my parents I'm staying
at a friend's house.

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:32.220
Me, too.

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:34.340
That's more like it.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.350
They're working well together.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.480
Yeah. Not bad.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:47.820
You were saved by this purple guy?
Is he a friend?

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:52.650
Nah, he picked a fight right after.
What's his deal?

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.360
Yeah?

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.080
--Minam--
--Hey!

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:02.410
Koyomi! Where have you been?!

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:10.260
Senpai, don't worry me like that!

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:11.380
Sorry.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:15.890
Huh? That's all? Did something happen?

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.600
That was you guys?

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.680
That was your atrocious fighting?

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:24.900
Atrocious?

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:29.780
Knight, please don't be
so rude right off the bat.

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:31.820
Who the hell are you?

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:34.990
We're the Gridknight Alliance.

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:40.450
Uh, the name's not important though.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:41.870
What the hell?

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:46.750
We protect the world
from the threat of <i>kaiju</i>!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.630
Protect the world... from <i>kaiju</i>?

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:52.670
How's that purple guy involved?

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:54.840
That would be me.

00:10:55.680 --> 00:11:00.510
Huh? You mean, you become that?
You transform?

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:03.640
Whoa. Talk about fantasy.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:08.360
I thought that red guy was
a <i>kaiju</i>, but I guess not.

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:10.730
Your ragtag crew got wrecked.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.940
You mean, Dynazenon?

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:15.900
Dynazenon. That's its name?

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:19.410
So? Did you come to fight <i>kaiju</i>?

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:24.250
That's right! Which is why
we want to cooperate with you.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.160
Cooperate?

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.460
Yup! And speaking of which...

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:30.340
We can use this Fixer--

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:31.800
No thanks!

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.340
Huh?

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:40.180
These guys are shady as hell.
They roll up on us out of nowhere?

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:42.390
You're one to talk.

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:44.220
I see.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:49.940
I'd rather not work with the wounded.
You'll only hold me back.

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:51.270
Say what?

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.320
I'm stating the truth.

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:59.450
Which is it? You wanna cooperate with us,
or are you picking a fight?

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.780
I see what you're saying.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:06.750
Let's go, Knight... For now.

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:07.750
Right.

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:13.880
What's up with them?
Get on the same page first.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:20.470
Was that smart, Gauma? Dynazenon's broken,
so shouldn't we fight together?

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:27.940
Dynazenon. When <i>kaiju </i>appear
in a world, so does opposition--

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:31.360
like antibodies that rise to defend it.

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:36.860
Yeah. But it seems pretty obvious
that they're not bad people.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:40.570
I just want to make sure of it.

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:45.240
It doesn't heal with time after all.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:48.330
Gauma.

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.620
Mmm?

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:54.170
Earlier, I went to save someone...

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:57.260
A person I think I hate.

00:12:57.260 --> 00:13:00.680
I see. Good on you.

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:06.270
Somebody once told me something:

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:11.400
"It's best to live honestly
with your feelings."

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:15.650
Was it the same person
you're searching for?

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:17.230
Yeah.

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:19.360
What kind of person was she?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:24.120
Someone who lived
in a world I couldn't reach.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:25.330
And...

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.080
And?

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:29.710
A total beauty.

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:34.130
She's the one who entrusted
Dynazenon to you?

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.630
Cool, right?

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.260
Sure is.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.300
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.300
DO NOT ENTER

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.300
JAPAN EXPRESSWAY

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:51.390
I wonder what Gauma plans to do.
We can't exactly fight <i>kaiju </i>like this.

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:57.150
You always carry that, huh?

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:06.830
Are you hot? Maybe I'll go buy something.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:12.000
This... It was Kano's.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.960
I always wanted to play with it.

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:23.050
Kano! Can I try it, too?

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:25.220
You're never getting it.

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:27.680
When Kano...

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:33.480
When my sister and I were little,
we got along just fine.

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:37.190
But before long, we grew apart.

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:41.190
Even at home, I hardly saw her smile.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:47.530
So when I saw her in that video
smiling and having fun in chorus club,

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:50.490
it kinda surprised me.

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:56.830
But the one time she invited me
to her recital, she was smiling.

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:00.460
I don't know why, but...

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:07.680
I thought, maybe she wanted to
get along again like we had in the past.

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:11.600
But that was the last time I saw her.

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:17.400
If Kano was really bullied...
If she really committed suicide...

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:22.230
I wonder why she smiled at me that day?

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:26.490
I honestly have no idea.

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:30.330
I guess I know nothing about Kano.

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:39.130
Hmm?

00:15:39.130 --> 00:15:41.300
Uh, sorry.

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:45.470
Why are you crying?

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:48.800
I don't know. I really don't know.

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:54.770
But you still don't know
if it was suicide or not.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:59.690
You still don't know why she was smiling.

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:02.980
Let's keep investigating more.

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:06.860
But she was just a stranger to you.

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:10.160
She was your sister.

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:14.500
If she was a part of you,
she's not some stranger.

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:21.250
What?

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:23.670
Your face.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.380
S-Sorry.

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:28.720
Talk about a runny nose.

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:31.760
I know. It's a snotty mess.

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:34.720
Yomogi.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:35.970
Yeah?

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.480
Thanks.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:45.320
I'll get us some ice cream.

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.650
Wait. I'll come, too.

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.840
You okay, Mujina? Need a break?

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:09.430
I'm fine. I don't get tired
when connected to <i>kaiju</i>.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:15.470
Real <i>kaiju </i>users don't sleep.

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:25.070
Hey, get up.

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:32.360
It's the <i>kaiju</i>. Dynazenon's not
in good shape, but we've got no choice.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.620
Dynazenon!

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:44.250
Battle--!

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:55.600
Dynazenon! This time,
we're gonna whoop your ragtag ass!

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:02.980
Your ragtag crew got wrecked.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:08.190
So what?! Being ragtag
is what brought us together!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:13.200
Still not sure about them?

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.370
No. Let's do it.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.630
We don't need help.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:34.260
Don't get me wrong. It wasn't to help you.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:38.640
Knight Bursting Light Bomb!

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:40.350
Something Beam!

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:53.450
The <i>kaiju</i>'s stronger than before.

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:56.320
Knight, I'll use Fixer Beam!

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:59.620
You sure? We only have one.

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:02.040
That's why I'm using it now!

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:07.000
Dynazenon! It's time to
get your power back!

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:14.050
Dynazenon healed!

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:16.260
Huh? How?

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:20.350
Now we can fight to our heart's content!

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:38.450
There's two of them and two of us!
There's no excuse to lose!

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:41.790
Right! We won't be beat!

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:05.060
Gridknight Circular!

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:06.940
Dyna Saber!

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:12.940
--Big Blade Strike!
--Knight Circular End!

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:24.120
If not for the irregular, we had that.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:28.460
Irregulars come because of <i>kaiju</i>.
It's a good omen.

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:33.340
Next time... Next time,
we'll do even better.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:37.170
You know it.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:40.340
You saved our asses! Uh...

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:44.010
This is Knight. Gridknight.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.640
And me, I'm the Second.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.100
The Second?

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.230
Of what?

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:53.070
I've gotta say thanks
for healing Dynazenon--!

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:56.990
Keep your hands to yourself.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.570
Sorry.

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:03.280
Until next time, guys!

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:08.910
Shoot! It's this late?!

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:10.250
Going somewhere?

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:11.710
To school!

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:15.050
Let's hurry. We might make it.

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:17.420
Access Mode... Dyna Wing!

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:25.680
FOR KISARAZU STATION

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:25.930
He said that you saved him! Thank you!

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:31.520
It helped us realize we should
value each other more.

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:32.350
Mmm.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:35.730
Thanks so much! Until now, I didn't--

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:09.100
Will you come along if I
look into Kano some more?

00:22:09.100 --> 00:22:12.810
Yeah. What's the plan?

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:16.900
I need to find this person--Futaba Senda.
